---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Contact GlobalsBlog | Editorial, Advertising & Tool Feedback"
	description="Contact GlobalsBlog for editorial questions, advertising opportunities, article corrections, calculator feedback, or any business inquiry. We aim to respond within 2 business days."
>
	<section class="content-page">
		<div class="content-hero">
			<p class="eyebrow">Contact GlobalsBlog</p>
			<h1>Get in touch — we respond to every genuine inquiry.</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				Whether you have a question about an article, want to explore an advertising partnership,
				found an error, or have feedback on one of our calculators — reach us directly at the
				address below. We aim to reply within 2 business days.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="contact-strip">
			<div>
				<strong>Email</strong>
				<p><a href="mailto:contact@globalsblog.com">contact@globalsblog.com</a></p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<strong>Location</strong>
				<p>The Edge Tower, Ramprastha City, Sector 37D, Gurugram, Haryana, India</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<strong>Response time</strong>
				<p>Within 2 business days for editorial and business inquiries</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="info-grid">
			<article class="info-card">
				<h2>What to contact us about</h2>
				<ul class="detail-list">
					<li>
						<strong>Editorial questions</strong> — Questions about an article, topic suggestions,
						or requests to cover a specific subject.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Corrections & updates</strong> — If you spot a factual error, outdated
						information, or a broken link in any article or calculator, let us know.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Advertising & sponsorships</strong> — Brand partnerships, sponsored content
						opportunities, and display advertising inquiries.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Calculator feedback</strong> — If a calculator result seems incorrect or you
						want to suggest an improvement or a new tool.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Content removal</strong> — Rights-related concerns, copyright questions, or
						requests to remove or update specific content.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>General feedback</strong> — Anything else about the site, its design,
						or how we can improve the reading experience.
					</li>
				</ul>
			</article>

			<article class="info-card content-card-accent">
				<h2>Before you write</h2>
				<p>
					To help us respond quickly, please include relevant details in your message — the
					article URL or calculator name if applicable, the nature of your query, and your
					contact name.
				</p>
				<h2 style="margin-top:1.25rem">What we cannot help with</h2>
				<ul class="detail-list">
					<li>Personal financial or legal advice — our calculators are informational estimates only</li>
					<li>Medical or health advice — consult a qualified professional</li>
					<li>Third-party site issues — we only manage globalsblog.com</li>
				</ul>
				<h2 style="margin-top:1.25rem">Useful pages</h2>
				<ul class="detail-list">
					<li><a href="/about">About GlobalsBlog</a></li>
					<li><a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
					<li><a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a></li>
					<li><a href="/terms-and-conditions">Terms and Conditions</a></li>
					<li><a href="/tools">Free Calculators</a></li>
				</ul>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
